      "side": 1,
      "message": "The downside of this is that the Blueprint fragments will no longer be syntax highlighted in Codesearch (or Cider, probably VSCode, or various other tools), nor will the \"lang:soong\" filter find them. We could update `recognize_language_classifiers_data` to recognise `.bp.fragment` as a Soong Blueprint file, but alternatively would it be possible to make `bpfmt` more liberal about formatting fragments of Blueprint files?",
      "revId": "d4d3ecf934d4aaf44cd082a5210253b96ce17d36",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
